WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.795
The key numbers are: up to a seventy percent
reduction in compression time versus state-of-the-art sparsification;

00:00:07.875 --> 00:00:13.735
up to three-and-a-half times faster total training
than DGC and up to thirty-six times

00:00:13.815 --> 00:00:17.465
faster than full synchronization at equal convergence;

00:00:17.545 --> 00:00:21.886
per-model speedups over DGC of about one-point-four
on ResNet50,

00:00:21.966 --> 00:00:25.409
two-point-two on ViT, one-point-seven on MLP-Mixer,

00:00:25.489 --> 00:00:28.655
and three-point-five on extreme classification;

00:00:28.735 --> 00:00:35.010
and a decoding overhead reduced from growing
linearly with the GPU count to nearly constant.
